    "description": "Dai-Ichi Cutter Kogyo k.k. engages in the construction and civil engineering activities in Japan. The company provides flat sawing, core drilling, wall and wire sawing, grooving, various dry cutting and drilling, and various metal cutting and drilling; concrete chipping, concrete surface treatment, metal cutting, plant equipment cleaning, and decontamination services; shot and vacuum blast and decontamination services; and various cleaning, polishing, mechanical cutting, stripping, and mirror floor polishing services. It also offers building maintenance services comprising drain pipe and cleaning/inspection/construction of water supply and drainage equipment, stormwater pipe and gutter cleaning, spring water tank and mechanical parking lot pit services; and fiberscope surveying. In addition, the company provides anchor work, burster work, industrial waste collection, transport, and intermediate treatment services. Further, it engages in repair of bridge, port construction, and dam-related construction; and renewal work comprising demolition work, seismic isolation work, and other construction services, as well as provides engineering services for railway. Dai-Ichi Cutter Kogyo k.k. was incorporated in 1967 and is headquartered in Chigasaki, Japan."
